  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞将{F4 84 04 01 01 01 B8 07}\n　归还给了伊丽莎白。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_830.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DF 10}辛苦您了。\n我已经确认过，\n那个宝箱已经空了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_830.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……这次的委托，一定让您\n比以往更有成就感吧。\n瞧您那充满自信的表情……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_830.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……我知道的。\n这就叫“得意脸”吧。\n能亲眼见识到，真是荣幸。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_830.bf.json:1:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E8 0E}……那么，这是您的报酬。\n请收下吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
